  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given series is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>First, we find the sum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>General term&nbsp;for the series, is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Using, the sum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>(</mo><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></munderover><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></munderover><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>680</mn></math></p><p>Now, we will find the sum&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the required sum<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>680</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>620</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
